{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043824_021a3327","chunk_index":16,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ae1d1fb8450d1498","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_853d5ef9216b528b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_92c510d2c44bc5b4","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_54b16d7c77a11828"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043824_021a3327","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","quote":"章节编号=10.1\n章节标题=病例报告表\n章节类型=section","quote_sha256":"6447184d36632457b7000b407b196d457c131d52971a622ba0c2c4028741508d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","span_id":"span_section_10_1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_exclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_adherence"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_intervention"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_section_10_1","span_project_visits","span_project_inclusion","span_project_exclusion","span_project_adherence","span_project_intervention"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"病例报告表","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究病例报告表（CRF）用于采集和记录方案要求的研究数据。CRF设计应与本研究的筛选期、双盲治疗期及安全性随访期访视策略一致，覆盖筛选和基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视及第20周安全性随访所产生的研究数据。CRF中应记录受试者是否符合入选和排除标准，包括年龄、斑块状银屑病病程、PASI、受累体表面积和sPGA等筛选及基线评估信息；应记录PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周的评价结果，以及DLQI评分数据。给药记录、通过药品计数和受试者日记评价的依从性数据、不良事件和严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件、实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图相关安全性信息也应纳入CRF采集范围。CRF数据的填写应及时、清晰、完整，并与源文件保持一致。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持本章节写入随访策略、入选/排除标准、PASI和sPGA评价时点、DLQI数据及依从性评价方式；需医学作者核对CRF具体字段、DLQI采集时点、文件填写方式及与数据管理计划的一致性。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ae1d1fb8450d1498","section_number":"10.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043824_021a3327","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","quote":"章节编号=10.2\n章节标题=数据源的定义\n章节类型=section","quote_sha256":"6b9ba2adaf432c3bd4112fcef014298054674764370efddde2c5f32f2f359d88","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","span_id":"span_section_10_2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_adherence"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_section_10_2","span_project_adherence"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"数据源的定义","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的源数据是指在源文件中首次记录的研究相关观察、检查和受试者信息；源文件是承载这些原始记录的文件、记录或系统。根据本研究的依从性评价安排，药品计数记录和受试者日记用于评价受试者对研究治疗的依从性，属于本研究依从性数据的源数据来源。病例报告表（CRF）用于采集和记录方案要求的研究数据，其内容应与源文件保持一致；当CRF与源文件不一致时，应以经核实的源文件为依据进行澄清和更正。研究中心应保证源数据可追溯、可核查，并能够支持对研究数据的核查与确认。","rationale":"已确认研究事实明确依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价，可作为源数据定义的项目依据；其余源数据与源文件定义为通用数据管理措辞，需医学作者核对本研究数据管理计划中的具体源文件清单、保存位置和核查方式。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_853d5ef9216b528b","section_number":"10.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043824_021a3327","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","quote":"章节编号=10.3\n章节标题=数据质量保证\n章节类型=section","quote_sha256":"3c092b371fa2945fa2f28aace0e1ff26be93ac2983b76bbb0fb44a4cc7206eb0","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","span_id":"span_section_10_3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国\n内在研究目的：确证性研究\n总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机\n目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者\n随机化方式：随机分配\n对照措施：匹配安慰剂\n分配模型：平行组（parallel assignment）\n中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"f8309c63422b41bdd03bbac1fb121378e256e598e29f5f1317c6d68c5a160c2a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_design"},{"locator":"section:数据质量保证|block:932|chunk:1","quote":"研究中心质量保证人员对数据转移文件、统计报告数据进行抽查，保证数据准确无误。申办者根据需要，结合试验进展情况及质量控制人员/监查员的核查结果，可对上述临床研究过程产生的数据进行不同范畴的稽查。","quote_sha256":"84e30f7a8178b6ecebc4f6b8272c753029708f78a4aea8f02201d0abf4225b0b","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db","span_id":"span_company_qa"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_section_10_3","span_project_design","span_company_qa"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"数据质量保证","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"数据质量保证应贯穿本研究数据产生、采集、转移和统计分析的全过程。质量保证活动包括对数据转移文件和统计报告数据进行抽查，以确认数据准确无误；根据试验进展情况及核查结果，可对本临床研究过程产生的数据开展不同范畴的稽查，以评价数据质量及研究实施是否符合方案和相关要求。本研究为多中心研究，各研究中心应保证源数据可追溯、可核查，并确保病例报告表数据与源文件一致。对于质量保证过程中发现的数据疑问或差异，应及时记录并完成澄清和更正，以维持研究数据的完整性和可靠性。","rationale":"已确认多中心研究设计支持质量保证范围；质量保证参考来源支持数据转移文件与统计报告数据抽查及按需稽查的表述。需医学作者核对抽查和稽查的具体责任、频次、流程及数据管理计划中的质量控制安排。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_92c510d2c44bc5b4","section_number":"10.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043824_021a3327","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"资料保存与数据保护","missing_source_classes":["资料保存与数据保护适用法规及申办方政策","数据管理计划（DMP）","研究中心归档与数据保护标准操作规程（SOP）","研究数据保存期限与销毁规则"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源未提供资料保存与数据保护的项目级规则，包括保存期限、归档责任、访问权限、数据保护措施及适用法规依据，无法形成有直接证据支持的实质正文；需医学作者获取相关来源后补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_54b16d7c77a11828","section_number":"10.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:35fc5c17eab87fe8b1e59945","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"16485d8c3f1d5694d853120c46a80788acf03ec34cdc665be7b0cc2dbf0e9557"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:数据质量保证|block:932|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"84e30f7a8178b6ecebc4f6b8272c753029708f78a4aea8f02201d0abf4225b0b"}]}